    {
      "title": "Dimensions",
      "material": "Vinyl (PVC)",
      "thickness": ".044 in. nominal",
      "profile": "Double 4 in. traditional lap; Double 4\u00bd in. Dutch lap",
      "height": "\u215d in.",
      "length": "12 ft 6 in. traditional lap; 12 ft 1 in. Dutch lap",
      "body": [
        "Dimensions is the .044-inch nominal-thickness lap siding in the Ply Gem Performance Collection. Its \u215d-inch profile creates a deeper shadow line, making the individual courses more defined across a broad wall. The folded nail hem and oversized lock are parts of the panel design rather than added accessories.",
        "Choose Double 4 traditional lap for a straightforward clapboard look or Double 4\u00bd Dutch lap for a beveled course with a more pronounced shadow. The profiles have different panel lengths, which matters when planning seams around windows, corners and long wall runs.",
        "Compare a full sample against the trim and roof color outdoors. The family palette includes solid and cedar-inspired finishes, but the chosen color still needs to be checked against the exact panel profile. Thickness alone is not a whole-wall wind rating; fastening and the supporting wall also matter."
      ],
